---
import BaseLayout from '@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
import { siteConfig } from '@/config/site';
---

<BaseLayout
  title={`About ${siteConfig.siteName}`}
  description={`About ${siteConfig.siteName}: free, client-side payment and creator fee calculators with dated schedules, named authorship, and transparent methodology.`}
  canonicalPath="/about/"
>
  <h1>About {siteConfig.siteName}</h1>
  <p class="answer-first">
    {siteConfig.siteName} builds free fee calculators for payment processors and creator platforms. Every tool runs in
    your browser, cites official pricing pages, and shows when we last verified each rate.
  </p>
  <p>
    We started this site because fee pages are scattered, regional rates differ, and “what should I charge to receive X?”
    is still harder than it should be. Our edge is freshness: a single versioned fee data file, public last-verified
    dates, and a documented <a href="/methodology/">verification methodology</a>.
  </p>
  <p>
    The site is maintained by <a href="/authors/">{siteConfig.authorName}</a>, an independent developer who reviews
    published processor pricing pages and keeps the calculators honest. Amounts you type never leave your browser — there
    is no server-side upload of invoice figures — so you can model pricing privately.
  </p>
  <h2>What we offer</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Forward and reverse calculators for major processors and creator platforms</li>
    <li>A comparison view across default schedules</li>
    <li>Guides on pricing after fees, Stripe vs PayPal, and hidden freelancer costs</li>
    <li>Embeddable widgets with credit links</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>How we stay accurate</h2>
  <p>
    Each schedule row links to an official source URL with a last-verified date. When providers change rates, we update
    the dataset, re-run formula tests, and refresh on-page dates. Corrections with evidence are welcome at{' '}
    <a href={`mailto:${siteConfig.contactEmail}`}>{siteConfig.contactEmail}</a>.
  </p>
  <h2>Independence</h2>
  <p>
    We are not affiliated with Stripe, PayPal, Square, Venmo, Block, Early Warning (Zelle), Patreon, Ko-fi, Buy Me a
    Coffee, Gumroad, Shopify, or Wise. Brand names are trademarks of their owners. Comparison rankings sort by calculated
    fee for the amount you enter — not by sponsorship.
  </p>
  <p>See also <a href="/authors/">authors</a>, <a href="/methodology/">methodology</a>, and <a href="/contact/">contact</a>.</p>
</BaseLayout>
